| `lawyerPortfolio/src/index.css` | Modify | Add @theme block with all tokens, @layer utilities for premium effects |
| `lawyerPortfolio/src/styles/tokens.css` | Delete | Merged into @theme |
| `lawyerPortfolio/src/styles/base.css` | Modify | Remove duplicated utilities (lines 186-1033), keep reset/typography |
| `lawyerPortfolio/src/styles/utilities.css` | Modify | Migrate premium effects to @layer utilities, keep remaining |

