## Testing Strategy

| Layer | What to Test | Approach |
|-------|-------------|----------|
| Visual | All premium effects render | Browser inspection: hero gold text, glass cards, button hover, nav underline animation |
| Dark mode | All colors switch correctly | Toggle dark mode, verify background/text/gold accents |
| Responsive | Breakpoints function | Resize browser: mobile hide, tablet grid, desktop full |
| No conflicts | Tailwind utilities work | Check: flex, grid, gap-*, spacing classes in components |
| Custom values | Shadows/radii render | Inspect card shadows, button border-radius |

## Migration / Rollout

No migration required. Pure CSS refactor with no data changes. Rollout: replace CSS files, verify in browser, git commit.

